WEBVTT

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.200
This snowstorm is getting stronger.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.350
If we don't hurry, we could
be trapped in a whiteout.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:15.550
But is there actually someone
waiting for you on Osorezan?

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:18.220
I think so.

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:22.060
Hahaha, you think so?

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.190
Well anyway, better change your clothes.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.020
It'll be cold on the mountain.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:31.150
Let's step on it!

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:34.110
Gu-chan's snow vehicle: Gumakura No. 1!

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.450
Full speed ahead!

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:43.980
Episode 33

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:43.980
Osorezan Le Voile Part 4

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:52.760
Yoh-san, I need to talk to you.

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:54.430
What is it?

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:55.770
Did you say something?

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:59.720
Gu-chan can't see or hear me.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.970
So please listen in silence.

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:06.440
As you fear...

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:12.400
There is little we can do
once we get to Osorezan.

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:17.280
My Furyoku is nearly depleted.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:22.450
And though you're a Shaman,
you're not yet ready to fight a demon.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:26.150
A demon can only be
defeated by another demon.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:30.040
Then what am I supposed to do?!

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:35.550
Anyway, I have to try.

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:40.680
Because I, I...

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:43.930
But there is still hope.

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:49.310
Wishful thinking is worthless
unless backed by works.

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:55.110
Life's problems must be confronted head on.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.280
Matamune?

00:01:58.320 --> 00:01:59.990
Even if that girl dies...

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:04.950
There will still be options available to us.

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:08.330
Listen carefully...

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:12.170
There is only one way
to defeat that demon now.

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:22.430
That feels good.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:36.610
I don't know how you got here...

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:43.200
But you've got guts to come here
alone now that I'm at my full strength.

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:46.620
Eh, Asakura Yoh?

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:48.500
Giant Demon...

00:02:49.910 --> 00:02:51.170
Where's Anna?

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.710
Eh? What's that?

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.340
You seem different somehow.

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:58.880
Tell me where Anna is.

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:03.010
I don't know.
What?!

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:06.180
Don't get upset.

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:09.180
She may still be alive.

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.390
What do you mean?

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:16.650
Well as you know, I came here to power up...

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:21.050
So I heaped verbal abuse on her in
order to attract and collect demon sprites.

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:23.160
And it worked splendidly.

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:29.580
But to my surprise, her Furyoku never gave out.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:37.170
In the end I got completely full,
and she wandered off somewhere.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.130
You bastard!

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:43.130
One I place for my father...

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:47.260
Two I place for my mother...

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:53.650
Three I place for my country,
those stone Jizo scare everyone.

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:55.530
Anna!

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:56.360
Shut up!

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.030
I hate them all.

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:03.360
Who do those bullies think they are?

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:04.660
Anna...

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:07.740
Her heart has been affected.

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:08.950
Heart?

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:16.290
At least she hasn't lost consciousness,
despite the Furyoku she's expended.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:22.120
What do you mean "At least"?!
You fork-tailed fool!

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:24.720
Anna!

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:29.180
You don't know what I've been through!

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.620
What it's like to be abandoned!

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:35.230
What it's like to hate and be hated!

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:38.110
<i>It's just like before.</i>

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:42.070
<i>Hao-sama suffered just like this...</i>

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:45.740
<i>And I could not save him.</i>

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.960
<i>But this time can be different.</i>

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:55.540
<i>I know how to defeat the
demon and save the girl.</i>

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:59.170
<i>And this time she has Yoh-san.</i>

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:01.960
Cut it out, Anna!

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:04.130
You'll catch a cold!

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:06.880
Argh... Shut up! Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:10.350
I wish you were all dead!

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:13.680
Why are you just sitting there?

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:18.270
If I created you, then
do as I say and kill them!

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:20.980
As you wish, Mama.

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:28.070
The time has come Yoh-san.

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:33.490
...All right.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:38.500
Soul integration!
Farewell, Matamune!

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.590
Soul integration?!

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:50.140
B-but how?!

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:55.140
That's a demon's power!

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:57.640
Impossible.

00:05:57.980 --> 00:06:01.400
And that sword, it belonged
to the split-tailed cat.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:05.780
Demon slayer, that's what Matamune called it.

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:08.310
So what?

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:11.890
You think that gives you a chance
against me? I'm all powered up!

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.490
Ora Ora Ora!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:17.160
Where is the little kitty hiding?

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.590
Matamune is right here.

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:32.800
And now, he can't
materialize his body for himself.

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:39.230
Matamune merged with me
so that I could defeat you...

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:41.100
Giant demon!

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:44.650
Soul integration.

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:48.990
So that's the only way
to defeat the Great Demon?

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:56.910
We can overpower the demon if I transfer
my remaining Furyoku to Demon Slayer.

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:01.670
But my body will dematerialize, so
I can't wield Demon Slayer myself.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:06.460
I'll have to become a ghost...

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:11.380
And enter your body to defeat the demon.

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:17.060
That is the only way to save the girl.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:18.180
Wha-

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:23.730
Well, you can just leave everything to me.

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:29.900
Like the demon's body, my body
was created by a human spell.

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:35.990
Once that spell is broken, I won't
be able to take physical form again.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:38.830
But...

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:41.500
I won't accept that!

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:46.340
I mean, that's..

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:50.760
We've only just met, haven't we?

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:52.880
And now...

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:58.010
We have to say goodbye?
Isn't there some other way?!

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:02.310
Always let your heart
choose your path, Yoh-san.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:07.360
I told you that the day we arrived in Aomori.

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:14.280
You mustn't let anything destroy your faith.

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:16.780
Faith?

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:22.250
Long ago there was a man I wanted to protect.

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:27.040
But one day I lost faith in him.

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:30.630
For a thousand years it's haunted me.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:36.470
The dark side of human
history repeats itself, even now.

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:39.470
People become embroiled in wars.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:42.490
People who bear the weight of regret.

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:46.690
And countless other worldly cares.

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:53.650
And the cause of all this sorrow is
their inability to have faith in others.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:57.140
You may be betrayed,
but if you have faith...

00:08:57.160 --> 00:09:00.470
You will never take the first step
on the road to hostility.

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:06.830
The path of happiness is the path of faith.

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:10.630
And faith is the true essence of love.

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:17.720
The question was not whether
my master was right or wrong.

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:26.190
I lost faith in him because of
the darkness in my own soul.

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:29.150
Matamune...

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:32.860
What am I saying?

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:37.780
Yoh-san you have something you must protect.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:40.620
Something to protect?

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:49.250
I am already dead, there is only
one reasonable choice for you.

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:50.670
But...

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:54.260
Besides, we may yet meet again.

00:09:55.130 --> 00:10:00.220
Oh yeah, you said your
body was made by a spell.

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:04.680
Then...

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:12.900
If I get to be as powerful as your former master,
will I be able to make a new body for you?

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.570
Without a doubt.

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:21.030
<i>By the time this battle is over...</i>

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:24.660
<i>My soul will have returned
to its intended resting place.</i>

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:28.410
<i>I have no more regrets.</i>

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:34.960
<i>That for which I have
searched a thousand years...</i>

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:39.510
<i>Is not before me.</i>

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:47.850
<i>Yoh-san, you are a friend
whom I can trust with anything.</i>

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:53.190
<i>Have faith in the girl.</i>

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:56.320
<i>The heart is a precious thing</i>

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:02.070
<i>You must protect her, no matter what.</i>

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:04.480
<i>Know this at least</i>

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:05.950
<i>Know this at least</i>

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:24.180
Do you take me for a fool?!

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:31.690
Wh-What's happening?!

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:35.020
My legs are fading, I can't stand up!

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:38.110
Is this his work?

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:41.990
No, this is what happened
to that medium-sized demon!

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:47.540
It's the girl, she's opening her heart again!

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:50.750
Why?

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:54.080
Why are you doing this?

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:58.710
Risking your life, sacrificing
someone you care about...

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:01.640
It'll work out somehow.

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:06.180
Then I'll become the
Shaman King and fix it for you.

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:10.270
And for what?

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:14.480
I still hate the whole world...

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:18.110
I hate and hate and hate.

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:23.110
I'm a bad person.

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:28.330
Hey, what are you doing, Mama?!

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:31.290
You can't let him pacify you so easily!

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:34.500
Have you forgotten all those bitter years?

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:39.130
Remember your suffering, your
hatred and hold on to your grudge!

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:44.380
I will never forget.

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.340
I will always...

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:49.220
Hate this world!

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:52.890
But…

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:56.880
But what I feel even more than that...

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:02.400
Is the love I feel for him.

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:08.990
The one who will disappear
is you, Giant Demon.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.040
I'll kill you!

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:16.870
I'll kill you and drag
you down to hell with me!

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:19.290
Right hand!

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:24.380
Take revenge on the one who
severed you, smash her to a pulp!

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:25.630
Anna!

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:28.300
You turned your back on me, boy!

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:30.470
Demon drum roll!

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:33.890
Hahaha! Go all of you!

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:36.890
Kill! Bite! Shred!

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:50.370
I-Impossible...

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:53.120
My demon sprites...

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:56.160
There’s blood on you.

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:58.750
Are you all right, Anna?

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:01.670
Good.

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:05.840
Well, that used up a lot of Furyoku...

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:11.800
I'd better finish this before it's all gone.

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:17.940
I guess it's time for goodbye, Matamune.

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:23.230
I really enjoyed the 3
days I traveled with you...

00:14:24.190 --> 00:14:27.110
I'll never forget you.

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:29.070
That's why…

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:36.200
And I promise I'll use this
to bring you back someday.

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:39.750
Goodbye.

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:43.130
Ultra Senji Ryakketsu:

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:49.840
Crescent Moon Purification

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:56.770
That was the last technique
Matamune did with me.

00:14:57.980 --> 00:15:00.770
I know now that those
demons were Over Souls.

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:03.560
As was Matamune's body.

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:08.900
But I didn't know that term back then.

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:17.370
That trip helped me prepare
for everything that was to come.

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:22.970
Grandma picked up all 1080
beads that were mediums for...

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:27.210
the demon sprites on Osorezan
and strung them together.

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:31.680
I kept Matamune's medium with me.

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:38.270
The journey was over.

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:42.480
Or so it seemed...

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:52.150
Yes, Matamune defeated the
demon and found rest at last.

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:57.030
I knew this was going to
happen, but I still miss him.

00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:00.750
Still, it all turned out
better than expected.

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:06.540
You don't have to look for a
potential bride anymore, Yohmei.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.380
Okay, Grandma.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.590
Thanks for seeing me off.

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:15.050
I'm fine now.

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:19.970
But you haven't fully recovered yet.

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:22.850
And don't you still have
some winter break left?

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:26.980
Yeah, I'd love to spend
it kicking back here...

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:30.360
But it might make Anna
uncomfortable, right?

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:35.740
She didn't come out of her
room once this whole week.

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:39.280
You're very thoughtful.

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:42.750
But hiding in her room is nothing new.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:45.250
Haha, I guess not.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:53.840
That girls sensitivity makes her
extremely anxious and reclusive.

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:58.850
Because she know how much
damage her feelings can do.

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:04.690
But someday, when she's
able to control her powers and fear...

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:08.110
She'll be a force
to be reckoned with.

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:15.450
She may be different the next time you see her.

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:23.000
She's a problem child, but take care of her.

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:25.580
I will.

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:28.330
Well, my train's here.

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:29.570
Hold on.

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:31.650
For you.

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:35.630
Doesn't look like a new year's gift.

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:42.680
I wonder what it is.

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:44.270
Just open it.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:47.560
Yeah, okay.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:52.400
Long time no see.

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:53.730
Anna?!

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:56.990
Not so loud.

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.280
You'll bother the other passengers.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.870
Okay, but what are you doing here?

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:04.870
And that outfit...

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.710
I'm better now.

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:10.630
You defeated my demons.

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:17.300
I thought it was hopeless,
but after what you did...

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:21.550
I decided to try to learn
to control my power.

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:26.180
I never want to suffer like that again.

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:29.650
Whether I have this power or not...

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:32.960
I want to be strong.

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:36.740
I'm glad to hear it.

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:39.400
She's plenty strong right now.

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:41.870
So I wanted to say...

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:44.790
Thank you.

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:50.710
I'll get off at the next station.

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:59.630
<i>Anna and I sat silently as
the train rattled down the track.</i>

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:07.060
<i>I wasn't sure why, but Anna took the train
from one station to the next just to thank me.</i>

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:13.270
<i>Did she do all this just so
grandma wouldn't see her?</i>

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:18.690
<i>Oh well, being stubborn's cute in it's own way.</i>

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:21.740
<i>She read my mind.</i>

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:30.790
I'm gonna hold you to your promise.

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:35.240
I don't think I'll forgive
you if you let me down.

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:43.590
Goodbye.

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.840
Obento

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:49.390
During the train home...

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:52.900
I opened the envelope Grandma had given me...

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:57.720
Mr.Hao

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:56.400
It was a letter addressed to me.

00:19:57.940 --> 00:20:02.610
Matamune had written it
before he left on new year's eve...

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:08.790
His handwriting was either too fancy
or too sloppy for me to read most of it.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:14.420
But as I sat looking at the
empty seats across from me...

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:18.170
Where Matamune had
sat on the way to Aomori...

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:21.260
I got tears in my eyes again.

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:28.810
Three poems were included with the letter.

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:36.330
<i>A ghost for a thousand years</i>

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:43.600
<i>I am finally discarding.</i>

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:50.480
<i>These lonely tears.</i>

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:57.150
<i>If only for a time. If only for a time.</i>

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:09.920
<i>My feeble heart fell. I am finally departing.</i>

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:17.260
<i>From this heavy, hollow shell.</i>

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:20.200
<i>Though there is no grave.</i>

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:23.470
<i>Though there is no grave.</i>

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:30.230
<i>I lived a long life. Filled with heartbreak.</i>

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:37.860
<i>Yet every new year. I awoke to Joy.</i>

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:48.410
<i>Love is hellos, good-byes and gossamer.</i>

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:55.000
<i>Osorezan Le Voile</i>

00:21:55.010 --> 00:22:01.590
<i>Though I am understanding.</i>

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:08.520
<i>I have felt the greatest of joys.</i>

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:15.020
<i>Life is ever changing, though it is often cruel, I do not mind.</i>

00:22:15.240 --> 00:22:21.440
<i>Please, give me a smile.</i>

00:22:21.480 --> 00:22:35.930
<i>My poem is through.</i>

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:51.270
<i>Soon my soul will enjoy a more heavenly view</i>

00:22:51.270 --> 00:23:02.030
<i>Love is hellos, good-byes and gossamer.</i>

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:08.620
<i>Osorezan Le Voile</i>

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:17.830
<i>Osorezan Au Revoir</i>

00:23:19.430 --> 00:23:23.610
I've served the house of
Asakura for a thousand years.

00:23:24.150 --> 00:23:29.490
I've just returned from my travels abroad
to accompany Yoh-san on his journey

00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:32.450
I am Matamune, the split-tailed cat.

00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:35.830
My favorite thing is catnip.

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:39.410
Until we meet again.

00:23:39.920 --> 00:23:45.970
<i>Le Voile: Veil
Voir: to see
Au Revoir: Until we meet again</i>

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:50.950
To Be King

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:50.950
To Be King

